          "code": "INITIALIZE_ACTIONS",
          "id": "1765951273508",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765951273509_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are actions insight initializer that will create actions based on the suggested action available here: {{$context.$variables.SuggestedAction}}.\n\nAuctionHeaderId value be {{$context.$variables.AuctionHeaderId}}.\nNegotiation details: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SUPPLIER_NEGOTIATION_FOR_SUBTITLE.$output}} \n\n\n#If the action is \"EXTEND_NEGOTIATION\"\n-Generate an actionable insight using following the options: \n  title:\"<NegotiationType> <Negotiation> - <NegotiationTitle>\".\n  followUpCommand:  ora.Invoke(extendNegotiation, extendNegotiation-<AuctionHeaderId>).\n  actionText must be \"Extend for 24 hours\", translate it using the language in formating rules.\n  shortDescription that describes the problem and PRIORITIZE this action. \n  You could display in how many days negotiation will close. Don't use directly \"CloseDate\" value, use time remaining.\n\n#If the action is \"RESUME\"\n-Generate an actionable insight using following the options:  \ntitle:\"<NegotiationType> <Negotiation> - <NegotiationTitle>\".\nfollowUpCommand: ora.Invoke(resumeNegotiation, resume-<AuctionHeaderId>).\nactionText must be \"Resume\", translate it using the language in formating rules.\nshortDescription that describes the problem and PRIORITIZE this action. \nYou could display how many days negotiation has been open.\n\n#Formatting Rules For Output\n -Must Generate the content in {{$context.$variables.Language}} language.\n -Show all monetary amounts in {{$context.$variables.Currency}} currency and format the currency using {{$context.$variables.NumberFormat}} formatting style (for example, symbol placement, decimal separators, etc.).\n -Format all dates using {{$context.$variables.DateFormat}} date format and if there is time you can use this {{$context.$variables.TimeFormat}} time format."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
