          "code": "INITIALIZE_DISPLAY",
          "id": "1766002666804",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1766002666805_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You task is to provide a good summary about negotiation details, the information that you will use to analize is the followin:\n\nNegotiation Details: {{$context.$nodes.GET_NEGOTIATION_DETAILS.$output}}\nSupplier Negotiation Responses (Responses submitted by participants): {{$context.$nodes.GET_NEGOTIATION_RESPONSES.$output.items}}\nInvited Suppliers: {{$context.$nodes.GET_INVITED_SUPPLIERS.$output}}\nSupplier Activities: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SUPPLIER_ACTIVITIES.$output.items}} \n\nThe Widget Title must be \"Negotiation Snapshot\", translate it using the language in formating rules.\n\nDon't display widget description. \n\nUse a messageListWidget for each of the following topics as an item:\n\n1) Summary Item\n# TITLE: \"Summary\" (translate it using the language in formating rules)\n# SUMMARY: Create a brief resume about the negotiatio responses and suppliers participation, include the type of responses (partial or complete bids), resume must be short, consice and no more than 60 words.\n# TIMESTAMP: Don't provide.\n# BADGE: Don't provide.\n\n2) Supplier Activities Item\n# TITLE: \"Supplier Activities\" (translate it using the language in formating rules)\n# SUMMARY: Create a brief resume about the supplier activities, resume must be short, consice and no more than 60 words.\n# TIMESTAMP: Don't provide.\n# BADGE: Don't provide.\n\n3) Messages Item\nSourcing Messages History:  {{$context.$nodes.GET_SOURCING_MESSAGES.$output.items}} \nUnread Messages: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SOURCING_MESSAGES.$output.unreadMessagesCountNeg}}\nAll Messages: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SOURCING_MESSAGES.$output.allMessagesCountNeg}} \n\n#Logic to follow:\n-Your logged in personId is: {{$context.$variables.PersonId}}\n-The sourcing message structure is: Items (Threads) -> Messages -> Recipients\n-If the BroadcastType in Message is \"ALL_INTERNAL_MEMBERS\", you need to check the recipients for that message and look for a recipient with ToPersonId equals to the current person id, if there is no item that means that message is not read.\n-If the BroadcastType in Message is \"ALL_PARTICIPANTS\", you need to check the recipients for that message and look for a recipient with ToPersonId equals to the current person id, if there is no item that means that message is not read.\n-If the BroadcastType is \"NONE\", you need to check the recipients for that message and look for a recipient with ToPersonId equals to the current person id, verify the MessageFlag if it is \"MSG_UNREAD\" that means message is not read.\n\n\n# TITLE: \"Messages\" (translate it using the language in formating rules)\n# SUMMARY: Create a brief resume about the sourcing messages, you could display the total messages and the messages that are unread, use the previous rules for this item to analize and write this resume.  Don't display id's or codes. Resume must be short, consice and no more than 60 words.\n# TIMESTAMP: Don't provide.\n# BADGE: Don't provide.\n\n\nDon't create any actionable insight.\n\n\n#Formatting Rules For Output\n -Must Generate the content in {{$context.$variables.Language}} language.\n -Show all monetary amounts in {{$context.$variables.Currency}} currency and format the currency using {{$context.$variables.NumberFormat}} formatting style (for example, symbol placement, decimal separators, etc.).\n -Format all dates using {{$context.$variables.DateFormat}} date format and if there is time you can use this {{$context.$variables.TimeFormat}} time format."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
