          "metadata": {
            "name": "Return From Extend"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RETURN_FROM_EXTEND",
          "id": "1779830349103",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1779830349103_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Check the return value from:\n{{$context.$nodes.EXTEND_NEGOTIATION_TIME_MANAGEMENT.$output}}\n\nIf the return value is SUCCESS, respond with a friendly confirmation message informing the user that the extend action was executed successfully for negotiation:\n{{$context.$nodes.SUPPLIER_NEGOTIATION_DETAILS_FOR_ACTIONS.$output.Negotiation}}. Mention that the close date was extended by 24 hours to {{$context.$nodes.EXTEND_NEGOTIATION_TIME_MANAGEMENT.$output.result.CloseDate}}.\n\n-Format all dates using {{$context.$variables.DateFormat}} date format and if there is time you can use this {{$context.$variables.TimeFormat}} time format.\n\nIf the return value is anything other than SUCCESS, respond with a clear error message informing the user that the extend action could not be executed."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_PRC_SOURCING_SUPPLIERNEGOTIATIONSAGENTIC",
            "errorNodeId": "1779842275299",
            "functionName": "NegotiationTimeManagementActions",
            "name": "Resume Negotiation Time Management"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1779830880269"
          },
